{
  "info": {
    "name": "Travel Orchestration Platform",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the Travel Orchestration Platform.\n\n## Authentication\n1. Use **Register** or **Login** to get a JWT token\n2. The token is auto-saved to `authToken` variable via test script\n3. All other requests use `{{authToken}}` in the Authorization header\n\n## Base URL\n- Local: `https://localhost:8443` (via API Gateway)\n- Change `{{baseUrl}}` variable to match your environment\n\n## Rate Limiting\nGateway rate-limits at 10 requests per 60s per IP (configurable). Hit `429 Too Many Requests` if exceeded.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://localhost:8443",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "authToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "destinationId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "travelId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "transactionId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "value": "john_doe",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "email",
      "value": "john@example.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "Password123!",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "managerId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "feedbackId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Public authentication endpoints. No token required.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', json.token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('username', json.username);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('email', json.email);",
                  "    console.log('Token auto-saved from registration');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"username\": \"{{username}}\", \"email\": \"{{email}}\", \"password\": \"{{password}}\", \"firstName\": \"John\", \"lastName\": \"Doe\", \"phone\": \"+1234567890\"}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/user/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "user",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', json.token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('username', json.username);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('email', json.email);",
                  "    console.log('Token auto-saved from login');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"username\": \"{{username}}\", \"password\": \"{{password}}\"}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/user/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "user",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
